---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE.name}>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <h1 class="name">Anandu Ramachandran</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">{SITE.tags.join(' · ')}</p>

    <p class="statement">
      “We are what we learn, what we read, the <em>stories</em> we remember,
      and the places we choose to wander.”
    </p>

    <div class="intro">
      <p class="greeting">Hey, I’m Anandu.</p>

      <p>
        I’m a software developer who enjoys technology, learning how things
        work, and solving problems. Outside of work, I’m usually reading,
        watching a movie, or falling down a rabbit hole about history and
        philosophy. I love a good book, and a genuinely great movie can make
        my entire day better.
      </p>

      <p>
        I’m also a huge anime fan, with <em>One Piece</em> holding a special
        place in my heart. I love travelling too, especially experiencing
        different cultures, food, and ways of life. I don’t get to do it as
        often as I’d like, but I hope to change that.
      </p>

      <p>
        The idea for this website came from one of my college seniors. I
        came across his website and really liked the idea behind it:{' '}
        <em class="quote">“a selfish pursuit of storing and curating
        knowledge”</em> and a living record of the things we learn along the
        way. That idea stayed with me and eventually inspired me to create
        my own.
      </p>

      <p>
        A lot of the elements and overall feel of this site are inspired by
        his work, and I’m grateful to him for introducing me to the idea in
        the first place.
      </p>

      <p>
        This is my little corner of the internet to collect the things I
        read, learn, and find interesting. Hopefully, it grows and changes
        with me over time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-8);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .name {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6.5vw, 4rem);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    margin-inline: auto;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .statement {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: 26ch;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .greeting {
    color: var(--color-fg);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .intro .quote {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-fg) 45%, var(--color-navy));
  }
</style>
